            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "Hey! Watch it, old boy, what're you blabbering?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "The reason Zofia doesn't want you in the Major's not just because she reckons you'll lose or get hurt..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "The competition isn't fair. See, the moment you set foot up higher, you're up against more than just your opponents..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "Think corps. Corps playing other corps. Families fighting other families."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "Not even them Adeptus watchdogs'll stick their hands in. Between the Knights Association, Grand Knight and all the directors, they make a three-way power tussle messier than you might ever imagine."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "Course, I wouldn't tell you to give up, Maria."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "'Think it through, look at all the difficulties you'll face, and only then should you press on. ' When you figure that one out, go knock 'em all the hell down for us old-timers to see."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "...Mm!"
    },
